  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as both a noun and a suru verb. Very common in political and social contexts. {支持|しじ}{率|りつ} (approval rating) is a term frequently seen in news about politics.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {支持|しじ}する: to support, to back\n- {支持|しじ}を{得|え}る: to gain support\n- {支持|しじ}{率|りつ}: approval rating, support rate\n- {支持|しじ}{者|しゃ}: supporter\n- {支持|しじ}{層|そう}: base of support, supporter demographic\n- {支持|しじ}{政党|せいとう}: party one supports\n\nWATCH OUT:\nNot to be confused with {指示|しじ} (instruction, direction), which shares the same reading.",
